@startuml

actor User as User
participant Frontend as Frontend
participant Backend as Backend
participant TaskScheduler as TaskScheduler
participant TaskDatabase as TaskDatabase
participant TaskRunner as TaskRunner

User -> Frontend: 访问前端
activate User

User <-> Frontend: 交互
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Backend: 请求数据
activate Backend

Backend -> TaskScheduler: 创建定时爬取任务
activate TaskScheduler
activate TaskDatabase
TaskScheduler -> TaskDatabase: 存储任务信息
deactivate TaskScheduler

Backend -> Frontend: 返回任务创建结果
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> Backend: 查询定时爬取任务
activate Backend
Backend -> TaskDatabase: 查询任务列表
deactivate Backend
Backend -> Frontend: 返回任务列表
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> Backend: 修改定时爬取任务
activate Backend
Backend -> TaskScheduler: 更新任务信息
activate TaskScheduler
TaskScheduler -> TaskDatabase: 存储任务更新
deactivate TaskScheduler
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> Backend: 运行定时爬取任务
activate Backend
Backend -> TaskScheduler: 触发任务运行
activate TaskScheduler
TaskScheduler -> TaskDatabase: 记录任务运行状态（开始）
deactivate TaskScheduler
activate TaskRunner
TaskRunner -> PythonScripts: 运行任务脚本
PythonScripts -> TaskRunner: 返回运行结果
TaskRunner -> TaskDatabase: 记录任务运行状态（成功/失败）
deactivate TaskRunner
deactivate Backend

Backend -> Frontend: 返回任务运行结果
deactivate Backend

Frontend -> Backend: 删除定时爬取任务
activate Backend
Backend -> TaskScheduler: 删除任务信息
activate TaskScheduler
TaskScheduler -> TaskDatabase: 删除任务
deactivate TaskScheduler
deactivate Backend

deactivate Frontend
deactivate User

@enduml
